# App Store Apps - Manual Installation Guide

This guide lists all App Store applications that require manual installation.

## Why Manual Installation?

App Store apps cannot be reliably automated due to:
- Apple ID authentication requirements
- Two-factor authentication
- License agreements
- Corporate policy restrictions

